  "notes": "Rule positions were measured off the scan by column/row ink projection: 22 vertical rules at a uniform 82.3 px pitch and 4 horizontal rules at 15/94/175/254 px. Each tick snapped onto a vertical rule — A on rule 3, B on rule 7, C on rule 10, D on rule 18 — so no position had to be guessed. Letters stay Latin A, B, C, D as printed. Canvas is 1600x320 and the product renders scroll media at 640 px, so the 46 px letters land at 18.4 px — above the 16 px floor."
